    <string name="settings_killswitch_on_title">Kill switch: ON (system-enforced)</string>
    <string name="settings_killswitch_on_body">Android is set to “Always-on VPN” with “Block connections without VPN” for this app. Traffic is blocked by the OS whenever the tunnel is down, including network changes and process restarts.</string>
    <string name="settings_killswitch_alwayson_title">Kill switch: OFF (always-on only)</string>
    <string name="settings_killswitch_alwayson_body">Always-on is enabled but “Block connections without VPN” is not. Traffic leaks while the tunnel is down. Enable the block option in Android settings.</string>
    <string name="settings_killswitch_off_title">Kill switch: OFF</string>
    <string name="settings_killswitch_off_body">This app cannot block traffic itself when the VPN is down. Enable “Always-on VPN” and “Block connections without VPN” for this app in Android settings to get an OS-enforced kill switch.</string>
